  "question": {
    "text": "The pulley shown in figure is made using a thin rim and two rods of length equal to diameter of the rim. The rim and each rod have a mass of $M$. Two blocks of mass of $M$ and $m$ are attached to two ends of a light string passing over the pulley, which is hinged to rotate freely in vertical plane about its center. The magnitudes of the acceleration experienced by the blocks is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ (assume no slipping of string on pulley). <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main_2026_watermark/21S2_q_33_1.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
